# Code Owners
# Each line is a file pattern followed by one or more owners.
# Owners are notified when a PR touches matching files.
# See: https://docs.github.com/en/repositories/managing-your-repositorys-settings-and-features/customizing-your-repository/about-code-owners

# Default: sole maintainer reviews everything
*                           @opensquad-ai

# Core framework (src-layout — code lives under src/)
src/opensquad/              @opensquad-ai

# Gateway & frontend
src/opensquad/gateway/      @opensquad-ai

# Plugin system
src/plugins/                @opensquad-ai

# CI / build
.github/                    @opensquad-ai
scripts/                    @opensquad-ai

# Documentation
docs/                       @opensquad-ai
*.md                        @opensquad-ai
